# Writer half of examples/lih_gnof_read_restart_use_ri.inp: LiH, 6-31G, GNOF, FULL_OPTIMIZATION
# TRUE, NON_REL + X2C + C4_SPINOR together, USE_RI left at its smart default (TRUE for all three --
# no CHOLESKY/SCF_DIRECT_4C/etc. override here, unlike lih_gnof_c4_full_optimization.inp's own
# dense/Cholesky path). Writes RESTART.NON_REL, RESTART.X2C and RESTART.4C, all from RI orbitals.
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
X2C TRUE
C4_SPINOR TRUE
FUNCTIONAL GNOF
PNOF_SUBSPACES 2
PNOF_COUPLING 2
FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   1.594900
END
